    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/9ec19d9bbc401379381052f8088a6e62.avif?t=1742077692\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/976563108dc39ec5885c7b9923389abf.poster.avif?t=1742077692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/976563108dc39ec5885c7b9923389abf.webm?t=1742077692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/976563108dc39ec5885c7b9923389abf.mp4?t=1742077692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/eb05530b78a75eabc5ed7bf2ad89f715.avif?t=1742077692\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/8e41b9390fa70172606b7633941967b3.poster.avif?t=1742077692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/8e41b9390fa70172606b7633941967b3.webm?t=1742077692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/8e41b9390fa70172606b7633941967b3.mp4?t=1742077692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been summoned by an enigmatic entity to prevent the end of this world. Explore the dark remains of post-apocalyptic structures, face nightmarish creatures, and befriend a colorful cast of characters in this story-rich RPG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interconnected original world to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An action bullet-hell combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfold an original and thrilling story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A colorful and chaotic cast of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique equipable items to create your own fighting style.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/9ec19d9bbc401379381052f8088a6e62.avif?t=1742077692\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/976563108dc39ec5885c7b9923389abf.poster.avif?t=1742077692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/976563108dc39ec5885c7b9923389abf.webm?t=1742077692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/976563108dc39ec5885c7b9923389abf.mp4?t=1742077692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/eb05530b78a75eabc5ed7bf2ad89f715.avif?t=1742077692\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/8e41b9390fa70172606b7633941967b3.poster.avif?t=1742077692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/8e41b9390fa70172606b7633941967b3.webm?t=1742077692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1484890/extras/8e41b9390fa70172606b7633941967b3.mp4?t=1742077692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been summoned by an enigmatic entity to prevent the end of this world. Explore the dark remains of post-apocalyptic structures, face nightmarish creatures, and befriend a colorful cast of characters in this story-rich RPG.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interconnected original world to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An action bullet-hell combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unfold an original and thrilling story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A colorful and chaotic cast of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique equipable items to create your own fighting style.</p></li></ul>",
